        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function pauses the sound if it was playing, otherwise (sound already paused or stopped) it has no effect.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1Sound_1a969d9c9c5e742ba91a39f7f12fed9096" kindref="member">play</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1Sound_1a90c9112782d5bc424a8e9e3ee7ecef19" kindref="member">stop</ref></computeroutput> </para>
