        <briefdescription>
<para>stop playing the sound </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function stops the sound if it was playing or paused, and does nothing if it was already stopped. It also resets the playing position (unlike <computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1Sound_1a24b31c90af33c6bdc302f876abdf8a39" kindref="member">pause()</ref></computeroutput>).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1Sound_1a969d9c9c5e742ba91a39f7f12fed9096" kindref="member">play</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classsf_1_1Sound_1a24b31c90af33c6bdc302f876abdf8a39" kindref="member">pause</ref></computeroutput> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
